WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.159
Hi there!

2
00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:03.936
Who are

3
00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:05.864
you? I'm an

4
00:00:05.865 --> 00:00:09.677
ostrich. I'm the

5
00:00:09.678 --> 00:00:14.565
biggest bird in the world. Where do

6
00:00:14.566 --> 00:00:16.962
you live? We live

7
00:00:16.963 --> 00:00:20.549
in Africa. We like

8
00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:24.819
the savanna and the desert. Do you

9
00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:27.612
have wings? Yes.

10
00:00:27.613 --> 00:00:31.321
We have wings. But

11
00:00:31.322 --> 00:00:35.021
we can't fly. We

12
00:00:35.022 --> 00:00:45.060
can run very fast though. Your

13
00:00:45.061 --> 00:00:47.840
legs look strong. Ostriches'

14
00:00:47.841 --> 00:00:51.992
legs are very strong. We

15
00:00:51.993 --> 00:00:55.527
can kick enemies with them. Our

16
00:00:55.528 --> 00:01:00.436
feet have sharp claws. What

17
00:01:00.437 --> 00:01:03.850
do you eat? We

18
00:01:03.851 --> 00:01:06.932
eat plants. We

19
00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:10.317
get water from them too. Sometimes

20
00:01:10.318 --> 00:01:15.524
we eat bugs or lizards. Do

21
00:01:15.525 --> 00:01:18.651
you live in a herd? Yes.

22
00:01:18.652 --> 00:01:21.188
One

23
00:01:21.189 --> 00:01:25.386
male ostrich is in charge. Females

24
00:01:25.387 --> 00:01:30.067
put all their eggs together.

25
00:01:30.068 --> 00:01:34.664
Do ostriches stick their heads in the ground?

26
00:01:34.665 --> 00:01:37.314
No.

27
00:01:37.315 --> 00:01:41.431
We just put our heads near the ground.

28
00:01:41.432 --> 00:01:46.298
That helps us hide from enemies.

29
00:01:46.299 --> 00:01:49.168
Oh, I see a lion!

30
00:01:49.169 --> 00:01:51.776
See you later.

31
00:01:51.777 --> 00:01:56.534
Bye, Ostrich!

